### C013 [K] OrbitGeneration.lean:69 def PreservesBody (round OG-1)
docstring OrbitGeneration.lean:68-68:
  | /-- Every member of `G` is an automorphism of `Ω`: it and its inverse map `Ω` into `Ω`. -/
header:
  > def PreservesBody (Ω : Set V) (G : Set (V ≃ᵃ[ℝ] V)) : Prop :=

### C014 [K] OrbitGeneration.lean:74 def SeedOrbitAvailable (round OG-1)
docstring OrbitGeneration.lean:72-73:
