  | /-- **The four-token coherence clause.** On the common body, the product of the coordinate
  | effects `(a, b)` on pair `01` and `(c, d)` on pair `23` equals the product of the coordinate
  | effects `(a, c)` on pair `02` and `(b, d)` on pair `13`. -/
header:
