### C054 [D] FourCopyCore.lean:177 abbrev FCC (round fourcopy)
docstring FourCopyCore.lean:176-176:
  | /-- The interface predicate for a family of pair cones. -/
header:
  > abbrev FCC (K : Pr → Set (W 3)) : Prop := FourCopyCoherent (K .p01) (K .p23) (K .p02) (K .p13)

### C055 [D] FourCopyCore.lean:180 def EvenCycle (round fourcopy)
docstring FourCopyCore.lean:179-179:
  | /-- Twist parity of the four-cycle. -/
header:
  > def EvenCycle (τ : Pr → Bool) : Prop := EvenCycle4 (τ .p01) (τ .p23) (τ .p02) (τ .p13)

### C056 [D] FourCopyDefs.lean:39 def IsConvexCone (round fourcopy)
docstring FourCopyDefs.lean:38-38:
  | /-- A convex cone of tables. -/
header:
